 "remarks": "COMMUTERS DREAM!! ..Stunning, Penthouse Condo with Water &City Views on a beautiful deck!! precisely located on the Norwalk River ONLY 2 BLOCKS away from BOTH the East Norwalk train station AND entrances to I95 , Enjoy your exclusive top suite with Soaring ceilings, with Skylights offering lots of natural light, updated. Featuring a cook's kitchen with Marble counters and a center island perfect for entertaining. Living room with huge windows, master bedroom with full bath and a nice sized 2nd Bedroom with plenty of closet space. Laundry in the unit. Reserved parking in the complex parking garage plus an additional reserved space outside.~2 miles from Calf Pasture Beach & Shady Beach ~1.5 miles from famous Stew Leonard's Grocery,-1.4 miles to SoNo Collection Mall ~1 mile away from Downtown SoNo and Veteran's Park (home of the famous Oyster Festival).Come home to tranquility. Nothing to do but put your feet up and enjoy!! Reasonable HOA fees and property taxes!! This unit is PRICED TO SELL!! Don't Miss OUT, Inventory is very scarce!!..Buyer Agents appreciated!!",
